{"seq":3,"slug":"locality-control","title":"局部性控制","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/chapel-parallel-programming/distribution/locality-control","wordCount":1947,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"局部性控制\">局部性控制</h1><p>全局视图让你能写 <code>A[i] = B[j] + C[k]</code> 而不操心数据在哪——这是它的恩赐，也是它的陷阱。因为在分布式数组上，<code>B[j]</code> 若不在本地，这行就悄悄发起了一次网络往返；一个写得天真的 <code>forall</code> 可能对每个元素都触发一次细粒度远程访问，把本该几秒的计算拖成几分钟。Chapel 不靠「祈祷编译器够聪明」，而是给你一套<strong>显式控制局部性</strong>的工具：<code>on</code> 把计算搬到数据处、<code>local</code> 块向编译器担保无远程、聚合把碎通信打包。这一篇讲怎么让数据和计算「待在一起」——它是分布式性能的命门。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>远程访问比本地访问慢约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍，哪怕只有 0.1% 的访问是远程的，它们也可能主导总时间。因此分布式性能的目标可浓缩成一句话：<strong>最大化本地访问比例，并把不可避免的远程访问从「多次细粒度」打包成「少次粗粒度」</strong>。Chapel 给你四件显式控制的工具：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong><code>on</code> / <code>localSubdomain()</code></strong>：把计算移到数据所在 locale——移动任务（几十字节）远比移动数据（兆字节）便宜；分布式 <code>forall</code> 已自动这么做，手写跨数组计算时要自己对齐</li>\n<li><strong><code>local { }</code> 块</strong>：向编译器担保「块内无远程访问」，省去 locality 检查换速度，但判断错会 <code>halt</code>——只用在能证明局部性的热点</li>\n<li><strong>聚合（<code>CopyAggregation</code>）</strong>：把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次延迟受限的小远程访问攒成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 次带宽受限的批传输，是直方图、图遍历、argsort 这类不可避免细粒度通信的解药</li>\n<li><strong><code>CommDiagnostics</code></strong>：量化每段代码的 GET／PUT／on 次数，把局部性优化从玄学变成「先测后改再测」的工程</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"局部性为什么是性能命门\">局部性为什么是性能命门</h2><p>回到<a href=\"../foundations/global-view-pgas\">全局视图与 PGAS</a>给的成本模型：本地访问 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{local}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 是纳秒级（一次内存读），远程访问要加上 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>comm</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{\\text{comm}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">comm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> ——一次网络往返，即便在 HPE Slingshot 这样的高速互联上也是微秒级，相差三个数量级。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>comm</mtext></msub></mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>comm</mtext></msub><msub><mi>c</mi><mtext>local</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>∼</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{c_{\\text{local}} + c_{\\text{comm}}}{c_{\\text{local}}} \\approx \\frac{c_{\\text{comm}}}{c_{\\text{local}}} \\sim 10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.0963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.2603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">comm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.9436em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">local</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">comm</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∼</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这意味着：哪怕只有 0.1% 的访问是远程的，它们也可能主导总时间。所以分布式性能优化的全部目标可以浓缩成一句话——<strong>最大化本地访问比例，并把不可避免的远程访问从「多次细粒度」打包成「少次粗粒度」</strong>。下面三件工具分别服务这两个目标。</p>\n<h2 id=\"on-子句-把计算移到数据所在处\">on 子句：把计算移到数据所在处</h2><p><a href=\"../foundations/locales-execution\">Locale 与执行模型</a>介绍过 <code>on</code> 改变计算位置。在分布式数组上下文里，它的核心用法是「计算去数据处」而非「数据来计算处」——因为移动一个任务（几十字节的描述）远比移动数据（可能是兆字节的数组块）便宜。</p>\n<p>Chapel 的分布式 <code>forall</code> 其实已经替你做了这件事：迭代分布数组 <code>A</code> 时，每个元素的处理任务被自动派生到 <code>A[i]</code> 所在的 locale。但当你手写跨多个数组的计算、或访问模式不规则时，就要自己用 <code>on</code> 对齐：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"chapel\" data-code=\"// 天真写法: 主任务在 L0, 对每个远程 A[i] 都 GET 再处理, 通信密集&#10;forall i in A.domain do&#10;  result += expensive(A[i]);&#10;&#10;// 局部性写法: 把计算派到 A[i] 所在的 locale, 就地处理&#10;forall i in A.domain do&#10;  on A[i] do                       // 计算迁移到 A[i] 的拥有者&#10;    result.add(expensive(A[i]));   // A[i] 现在是本地访问\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>// 天真写法: 主任务在 L0, 对每个远程 A[i] 都 GET 再处理, 通信密集</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>forall i in A.domain do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  result += expensive(A[i]);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 局部性写法: 把计算派到 A[i] 所在的 locale, 就地处理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>forall i in A.domain do</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  on A[i] do                       // 计算迁移到 A[i] 的拥有者</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    result.add(expensive(A[i]));   // A[i] 现在是本地访问</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>A.localSubdomain()</code> 还能让你直接拿到「本 locale 拥有的那部分下标」，写出显式的 owner-computes 循环，彻底避免试探性的远程访问。</p>\n<h2 id=\"local-块-向编译器担保-这里没有远程\">local 块：向编译器担保「这里没有远程」</h2><p>编译器为了正确性，默认假设分布数组的任何访问<strong>都可能</strong>是远程的，于是每次访问都插入一段「检查是否本地、不是则发通信」的代码——这层检查本身有开销。当你<strong>确知</strong>某段代码只碰本地数据时，用 <code>local { }</code> 块告诉编译器去掉这层检查：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"chapel\" data-code=\"forall i in A.localSubdomain() {&#10;  local {                          // 担保: 此块内无远程访问&#10;    A[i] = A[i] * 2.0 + bias;      // 编译器省去 locality 检查, 生成纯本地代码&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>forall i in A.localSubdomain() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  local {                          // 担保: 此块内无远程访问</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    A[i] = A[i] * 2.0 + bias;      // 编译器省去 locality 检查, 生成纯本地代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>local</code> 是一种<strong>契约</strong>：你保证块内不发生远程访问，编译器据此生成更紧凑的代码。但它是一把双刃剑——如果你判断错了，块内真的访问了远程数据，运行时会抛 <code>halt</code>（调试构建）或行为未定义（优化构建）。所以 <code>local</code> 只用在你能严格证明局部性的热点上，通常配合 <code>localSubdomain()</code> 一起用。它和<a href=\"../parallelism/task-parallelism\">任务并行</a>里的「私有累积」是一对：先在 <code>local</code> 块内算本地部分，再跨节点合并。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  F[&quot;forall 遍历分布数组 A&quot;] --&gt; Q{访问 A i 时}&#10;  Q --&gt;|默认| C[插入 locality 检查&lt;br/&gt;本地→直接读, 远程→发 GET]&#10;  Q --&gt;|包在 local 块| L[跳过检查, 当作本地&lt;br/&gt;更快, 但判断错则 halt]&#10;  C --&gt; R[正确但每次访问有检查开销]&#10;  L --&gt; P[最快, 需你证明无远程]\">flowchart TD\n  F[\"forall 遍历分布数组 A\"] --&gt; Q{访问 A i 时}\n  Q --&gt;|默认| C[插入 locality 检查&lt;br/&gt;本地→直接读, 远程→发 GET]\n  Q --&gt;|包在 local 块| L[跳过检查, 当作本地&lt;br/&gt;更快, 但判断错则 halt]\n  C --&gt; R[正确但每次访问有检查开销]\n  L --&gt; P[最快, 需你证明无远程]</pre><h2 id=\"聚合-把成千上万次小通信打包成一次\">聚合：把成千上万次小通信打包成一次</h2><p>有些算法天生要远程访问，无法靠 <code>on</code> 消除——比如直方图（每个元素要原子地加到一个可能在远端的桶）、图遍历（边指向任意节点）。这类「细粒度、不规则、不可避免」的远程访问，朴素做法是每次一个网络往返，通信彻底碎片化，带宽用不满。</p>\n<p>对策是<strong>聚合（aggregation）</strong>：不立即发送每次远程更新，而是先攒进一个本地缓冲区，攒够一批再一次性批量发往目标 locale。这把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次小往返（受<strong>延迟</strong>支配）变成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 次大传输（受<strong>带宽</strong>支配，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 是批大小），在高延迟网络上能有数量级提升。Chapel 标准库提供了 <code>CopyAggregation</code> 模块的 <code>SrcAggregator</code>／<code>DstAggregator</code>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"chapel\" data-code=\"use CopyAggregation;&#10;forall (i, v) in zip(srcIdx, values) with (var agg = new DstAggregator(real)) {&#10;  agg.copy(dst[i], v);      // 不立即远程写, 攒批; 离开作用域时自动 flush&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use CopyAggregation;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>forall (i, v) in zip(srcIdx, values) with (var agg = new DstAggregator(real)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  agg.copy(dst[i], v);      // 不立即远程写, 攒批; 离开作用域时自动 flush</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>聚合是 Arkouda 能在 8192 个节点上把 256 TiB 数据 31 秒排完的关键技术之一——argsort 大量依赖跨节点的聚合式 gather／scatter。这套手法的威力与度量，<a href=\"../practice/chapel-performance\">性能与扩展性</a>会用真实数字展开。</p>\n<h2 id=\"度量局部性-commdiagnostics\">度量局部性：CommDiagnostics</h2><p>凭直觉猜通信在哪发生往往出错，Chapel 给了内建的通信剖析器 <code>CommDiagnostics</code>。它统计一段代码触发了多少次远程 GET／PUT／执行（on），让你把「这段慢」精确定位到「这段发了一百万次远程读」：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"chapel\" data-code=\"use CommDiagnostics;&#10;startCommDiagnostics();&#10;myKernel();                          // 待测代码&#10;stopCommDiagnostics();&#10;writeln(getCommDiagnostics());       // 打印每 locale 的 GET/PUT/on 计数\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use CommDiagnostics;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>startCommDiagnostics();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>myKernel();                          // 待测代码</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>stopCommDiagnostics();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>writeln(getCommDiagnostics());       // 打印每 locale 的 GET/PUT/on 计数</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这是局部性优化的指南针：先测，看通信集中在哪，再决定是用 <code>on</code> 重排、<code>local</code> 提速，还是聚合打包。盲目优化是浪费——<code>CommDiagnostics</code> 让局部性从「玄学」变成「可量化的工程」。养成「改前测、改后再测」的习惯，是写出真正可扩展 Chapel 代码的分水岭。</p>\n<p>下表把这四件局部性工具及其定位汇成一张速查表：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>解决什么</th>\n<th>收益机制</th>\n<th>风险/代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>on</code> / <code>localSubdomain()</code></td>\n<td>计算没贴着数据</td>\n<td>把任务移到数据处（任务比数据轻）</td>\n<td>用错反而增加任务迁移</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>local { }</code> 块</td>\n<td>locality 检查的常数开销</td>\n<td>担保无远程，省去检查</td>\n<td>判断错会 halt/未定义</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>聚合（<code>CopyAggregation</code>）</td>\n<td>不可避免的细粒度远程访问</td>\n<td>把延迟受限的小往返打包成带宽受限的大传输</td>\n<td>需攒批，有缓冲延迟</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>CommDiagnostics</code></td>\n<td>不知道通信在哪</td>\n<td>量化 GET/PUT/on 次数，定位热点</td>\n<td>仅诊断，不优化本身</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>远程访问比本地访问慢约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 倍，哪怕 0.1% 的远程访问也可能主导总时间——分布式性能的核心目标是<strong>最大化本地访问、把碎通信打包成粗通信</strong>。</li>\n<li><code>on</code>（含 <code>on A[i]</code>、<code>localSubdomain()</code>）把计算移到数据所在 locale，因为移动任务比移动数据便宜；分布式 <code>forall</code> 已自动这么做，手写跨数组计算时要自己对齐。</li>\n<li><code>local { }</code> 块向编译器担保「块内无远程访问」，省去 locality 检查换取速度，但判断错会 halt——只用在能证明局部性的热点。</li>\n<li><strong>聚合</strong>（<code>CopyAggregation</code> 的 <code>SrcAggregator</code>/<code>DstAggregator</code>）把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 次延迟受限的小远程访问攒成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N/B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 次带宽受限的批传输，是不可避免的细粒度通信（直方图、图遍历、argsort）的解药。</li>\n<li><code>CommDiagnostics</code> 量化每段代码的 GET/PUT/on 次数，把局部性优化从玄学变成「先测后改再测」的工程。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>延伸阅读：本章到此结束，这些手法的真实收益见<a href=\"../practice/chapel-performance\">性能与扩展性</a>；<code>on</code> 的模型基础在<a href=\"../foundations/locales-execution\">Locale 与执行模型</a>；为什么分布选得好就能少通信回看<a href=\"distributions\">分布（Block/Cyclic）</a>。横向对照共享内存下的同步开销见 <a href=\"../../concurrency-models/shared-memory-and-async/locks-and-synchronization\">并发模型：锁与同步</a>。</p>\n<p>来源：<a href=\"https://chapel-lang.org/docs/\">Chapel Documentation 2.8 — CommDiagnostics &amp; CopyAggregation</a>、<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/2111.10333\">Improving a High Productivity Data Analytics Chapel Framework (arXiv:2111.10333)</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"局部性控制","id":"局部性控制"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"局部性为什么是性能命门","id":"局部性为什么是性能命门"},{"level":2,"text":"on 子句：把计算移到数据所在处","id":"on-子句-把计算移到数据所在处"},{"level":2,"text":"local 块：向编译器担保「这里没有远程」","id":"local-块-向编译器担保-这里没有远程"},{"level":2,"text":"聚合：把成千上万次小通信打包成一次","id":"聚合-把成千上万次小通信打包成一次"},{"level":2,"text":"度量局部性：CommDiagnostics","id":"度量局部性-commdiagnostics"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"分布 (Block/Cyclic)","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/chapel-parallel-programming/distribution/distributions"},"next":{"title":"与 C 库互操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/chapel-parallel-programming/practice/interop-c-libraries"}}